><div class="eyebrow"><div class="badge badge-circle badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Oct. 31, 2026</span></div></div><div class="update-content"><div class="update-section"><div class="badge badge-normal badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Buildout progress</span></div><ul class="body-3"><li><a href="/data/ai-data-centers/directory/anthropic-lake-mariner">Anthropic Lake Mariner</a><ul class="change-list"><li>Compute increased from 59k to 293k H100e.</li><li>Power increased from 42 to 210 MW.</li><li>Cost increased from $1.6 to $8.0 B.</li><li>TPU v7 chips increased from 25.1k to 125.6k.</li></ul></li></ul></div></div></article><article class="update-entry"><div class="eyebrow"><div class="badge badge-circle badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Oct. 30, 2026</span></div></div><div class="update-content"><div class="update-section"><div class="badge badge-normal badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Revisions</span></div><ul class="body-3"><li><a href="/data/ai-data-centers/directory/qts-cedar-rapids">QTS Cedar Rapids</a><ul class="change-list"><li>Owner set to Meta (speculative).</li><li>Users set to Meta (speculative).</li><li>Projected compute decreased from 3,669k to 2,251k H100e.</li><li>Projected Rubin chips decreased from 325.4k to 196.8k.</li><li>Added projected chip type: B300 (202k).</li></ul></li><li><a href="/data/ai-data-centers/directory/vnet-bayin-ulanqab">VNET Bayin Ulanqab</a>: <!-- -->Owner changed from &quot;VNET&quot; to &quot;ByteDance (speculative)&quot;.</li></ul></div></div></article><article class="update-entry"><div class="eyebrow"><div class="badge badge-circle badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Oct. 28, 2026</span></div></div><div class="update-content"><div class="update-section"><div class="badge badge-normal badge-l badge-color-default trim"><span class="badge-text">Newly added</span></div><ul class="body-3"><li><a href="/